# E2E Bridge Probe Mode ({NAME})

This mode exists only so its name and description travel through GET /v1/modes into the
amplifier-opencode launcher's agent-file bridge. It is never activated -- the bridge suite
asserts on the generated `.opencode/agent/amplifier-{NAME}.md` file and ownership manifest,
not on this body.
